post.description:
Launch an nmap auto-discovery scan against a target IP or CIDR range.

The scan runs in the background.  Poll GET /setup/discover/{scan_id}
for results.

Called by the AEGIS Node app on the target machine.
Generates a short enrollment code that the user pastes in the dashboard.
Body: { agent_id, hostname, os_info, ip_address, agent_version }

Move a file into quarantine after integrity verification.

Safety properties:
  * only paths under AEGIS_QUARANTINE_ROOTS (empty = disabled);
  * absolute, non-symlink, regular files only;
  * caller must supply the file's SHA-256 and explicit confirmation;
  * AEGIS's own files and the quarantine directory are never touched;
  * the copy is fsynced before the original is unlinked.
